No transform is recommended. These figures measure how much each transform CHANGED the image, not whether it helped. PRD 6 requires any transform to be evaluated enabled and disabled on known references, and no reference manifest exists for this corpus. A transform that raises sharpness while also raising blocking_ratio is amplifying compression structure, which at a 30x20 px object scale is indistinguishable from amplifying the object.

